WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.474
Hi! Can you work out 47 plus 38 quickly without pencil and paper? Today we'll learn ways to add and subtract two-digit numbers in our heads.

2
00:00:12.624 --> 00:00:16.290
Let's work out 47 plus 38.

3
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.306
First add the tens: 47 plus 30 is 77.

4
00:00:21.456 --> 00:00:26.154
Then add the ones: 77 plus 8 is 85.

5
00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:37.506
Subtraction works the same way: 82 minus 37. Take away 30 to get 52, then take away 7 to get 45.

6
00:00:37.656 --> 00:00:45.354
29 is very close to 30. For 56 plus 29, add 30 and then take away 1.

7
00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:52.770
56 plus 30 is 86. We added 1 too many, so take away 1 to get 85.

8
00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:58.194
For 73 minus 48, take away 50 and then add 2.

9
00:00:58.344 --> 00:01:06.714
73 minus 50 is 23. We took away 2 too many, so add 2 to get 25.

10
00:01:06.864 --> 00:01:14.778
Watch out! Some pupils change 29 to 30, then add another 1 and get 87. That's wrong!

11
00:01:14.928 --> 00:01:22.746
We needed to add 29 but added 30, which is 1 too many. So we take away 1, and the answer is 85.

12
00:01:22.896 --> 00:01:30.426
Remember: if you added too much, take it back. If you took away too much, add it back.

13
00:01:30.576 --> 00:01:39.258
Your turn! What is 65 plus 27? Pause and think.

14
00:01:39.408 --> 00:01:47.658
65 plus 20 is 85, then plus 7 is 92. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:56.586
Another one! What is 91 minus 46? Pause and think.

16
00:01:56.736 --> 00:02:04.698
91 minus 40 is 51, then minus 6 is 45. Did you get it right?

17
00:02:04.848 --> 00:02:13.386
Here's another! What is 38 plus 45? Pause and think.

18
00:02:13.536 --> 00:02:21.450
38 plus 40 is 78, then plus 5 is 83. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:30.330
Here's another! What is 64 minus 19? Pause and think.

20
00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:39.738
Take away 20 to get 44. That's 1 too many, so add 1 back: 45. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:39.888 --> 00:02:50.682
Last one! Are 47 plus 38 and 38 plus 47 the same? Pause and think.

22
00:02:50.832 --> 00:03:00.282
Yes! Swapping the numbers in an addition doesn't change the answer. Both are 85. Did you get it right?

23
00:03:00.432 --> 00:03:09.186
Remember: in mental maths, work out the tens first and then the ones. For numbers close to a ten, round and then adjust.

24
00:03:09.336 --> 00:03:14.754
Today on a ride, try adding two numbers you see in your head!

